  "name": "rhaposPDE",
  "description": "rhaposPDE is a curated collection of mathematical puzzles and challenges focused on the theory and application of partial differential equations (PDEs). Conceived as a thematic exploration of mathematical physics, the repository aggregates problems ranging from fundamental boundary value scenarios to complex analytical derivations. It serves as a conceptual framework for deepening understanding of elliptic, parabolic, and hyperbolic operators through structured problem-solving.",
